{{!< default}}
{{#post}}
<article class="gh-article {{post_class}}">
    <header class="gh-post-header gh-canvas">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Effective November 20, 2026</p>
    </header>
    <section class="gh-content gh-canvas">
        <p>
            {{@site.title}} is operated by Zach Ward. This policy explains what information is
            collected when you visit the site, subscribe, receive email updates, or leave a
            comment.
        </p>
        <h2>Information collected</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Your email address when you create a free membership or subscribe to updates.</li>
            <li>
                Information associated with your membership and comments, such as your name,
                email address, comment text, and posting date.
            </li>
            <li>
                Basic technical information that is normally processed by a web server, such as
                your IP address, browser type, device information, and requested pages. This
                information is used to operate the site and protect it from abuse.
            </li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How information is used</h2>
        <p>Information is used to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Maintain memberships and sign-in access.</li>
            <li>Publish and manage comments.</li>
            <li>Send email updates that you request.</li>
            <li>Operate, secure, troubleshoot, and improve the site.</li>
            <li>Comply with legal obligations and respond to legitimate requests.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Email updates</h2>
        <p>
            When you subscribe, Ghost may use Mailgun or another email service provider to
            deliver messages. Those providers process the information needed to send email on
            our behalf. Every bulk email will include an unsubscribe link. You may unsubscribe
            at any time.
        </p>
        <h2>Comments</h2>
        <p>
            Comments may be publicly visible. Do not include private or sensitive information
            in a comment. We may remove comments that are unlawful, abusive, spam, or otherwise
            inappropriate.
        </p>
        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
            Ghost may use cookies needed for membership sign-in, security, and basic site
            operation. This site does not currently use advertising cookies or analytics
            tracking.
        </p>
        <h2>Sharing information</h2>
        <p>
            Personal information is shared only with service providers that help operate the
            site, such as hosting, Ghost infrastructure, and email delivery providers, or when
            disclosure is required by law. We do not sell personal information or use it for
            cross-context behavioral advertising.
        </p>
        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>
            Membership and comment information is retained while it is needed to provide the
            service, maintain site records, resolve disputes, or meet legal obligations. You may
            request deletion of your membership information, subject to records we must retain.
        </p>
        <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
        <p>
            You may unsubscribe from email updates using the link in each message. Depending on
            applicable law, you may also request access to, correction of, or deletion of
            personal information associated with you. Contact us to make a request; we may need
            to verify your identity first.
        </p>
        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>
            Reasonable measures are used to protect information, but no website or internet
            transmission can be guaranteed completely secure.
        </p>
        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
            This site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
            personal information from them. Contact us if you believe a child has provided
            personal information.
        </p>
        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
            This policy may be updated when the site's practices or legal requirements change.
            The effective date above will be revised
        </p>
        <p>
            This policy may be updated when the site's practices or legal requirements change.
            The effective date above will be revised when this policy is updated.
        </p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
            For privacy questions or requests, email
            <a href="mailto:privacy@z-a-c-h.com">privacy@z-a-c-h.com</a>.
        </p>
    </section>
</article>
{{/post}}
